[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=kdock Systray
Comment=System tray (StatusNotifierItem host) for kdock
Exec=@CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_BINDIR@/kdock-systray
Icon=preferences-desktop-notification
Categories=Utility;
NoDisplay=true
# No X-KDE-Wayland-Interfaces / X-KDE-DBUS-Restricted-Interfaces here: the tray
# window is a layer-shell surface (zwlr_layer_shell_v1 is not on KWin's
# restricted list) and the StatusNotifierItem protocol is plain session D-Bus.
# The entry exists so the window carries a name and an icon in the task switcher.
